        "posts": [
          {
            "id": "6adac6357dd21bbcec945ec8",
            "text": "Thanks to everyone who came out to last Sunday\u2019s fossil sorting! It was a packed house and we got a lot of material sorted. Special thanks to all of the first-time sorters - hopefully we\u2019ll see you again! Our next session is Sunday, November 1. See https://albertapaleo.org/fossilsorting for more details! #palaeontology #paleontology #fossils #mammal #alberta",
            "sent_on": "2026-10-29",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1429489689258643",
            "reactions": 33,
            "comments": 3
          },
          {
            "id": "6adeab5f4dd430dcf4e7ded0",
            "text": "We have a new t-shirt available! This brand new design, done by palaeoartist Max Bley, was done in order to celebrate the APS' 40th anniversary, which takes place in October. The shirt celebrates Alberta palaeontology in all of its forms. This shirt is available for both adults and children. See our online store (https://albertapaleo.org/store/ ) or you can purchase them during our monthly meetings. Thanks Max for the awesome design! #palaeontology #paleontology #alberta",
            "sent_on": "2026-11-05",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1436435408564071",
            "reactions": 20,
            "comments": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "6adea72f38e72972eaae1e06",
            "text": "Another bevy of palaeontological events! Wednesday, October 28, 5 - 7pm: Halloween Party @ ESB 1-39, University of Alberta (University of Alberta Palaeontological Society) Wednesday, October 28, 6 - 6:45pm; October 29 9:30 - 10:15am & 11 - 11:45am: 10 Scariest Specimens (Royal Tyrrell Museum of Palaeontology) Saturday, October 31, 10am - 2pm: The Mystery Dinosaur @ Philip J. Currie Dinosaur Museum, Wembley, AB Sunday, November 1, 1 - 3:30pm: Microfossil Sorting! (APS) https://albertapaleo.org/events/calendar #palaeontology #paleontology #fossils #dinosaurs #events",
            "sent_on": "2026-10-26",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1426483409559271",
            "reactions": 10,
            "comments": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "6af21d61f4d93202cd1fddfa",
            "text": "Dinovember is spinning up! Friday, November 13 - November 14: Dinovember Sleepover @ Royal Tyrrell Museum of Palaeontology, Drumheller, AB Friday, November 13: DINOvember \u2013 Baytex Energy Centre @ Peace River, AB (Philip J. Currie Dinosaur Museum) Saturday, November 14: DINOvember \u2013 Eastlink Centre @ Grande Prairie, AB (Philip J. Currie Dinosaur Museum) For more information: see https://albertapaleo.org/events/calendar #palaeontology #paleontology #fossils #dinosaurs #events",
            "sent_on": "2026-11-09",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1440810854793193",
            "reactions": 8,
            "comments": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "6ae8c3d23a8203482c947c5e",
            "text": "Palaeo events galore! Wednesday, November 4, 5 - 7pm: Art Night @ ESB 1-39, University of Alberta (University of Alberta Palaeontological Society) Saturday, November 7, 1 - 3pm: DINOvember \u2013 Grande Cache @ Grande Cache, AB (Philip J. Currie Dinosaur Museum) Saturday, November 7, 12:30 - 5pm: Seven Wonders of Science @ Calgary (University of Calgary Faculty of Science) https://albertapaleo.org/events/calendar #palaeontology #paleontology #fossils #dinosaurs #events",
            "sent_on": "2026-11-02",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1433648918842720",
            "reactions": 8,
            "comments": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "6ad619d8217d6d49847487d9",
            "text": "It's the start of spooky season, and the Halloween-themed events are starting to appear! Friday, October 23, 6:30pm - October 24, 9:30am: Night at the Museum: Halloween Edition @ Wembley, AB (Philip J. Currie Dinosaur Museum) For more information: see https://albertapaleo.org/events/calendar #palaeontology #paleontology #fossils #dinosaurs #events",
            "sent_on": "2026-10-19",
            "url": "https://www.facebook.com/1412565477617731/posts/1420070736867205",
