            "id": "6adeab5f4dd430dcf4e7ded1",
            "text": "We have a new t-shirt available! This brand new design, done by palaeoartist Max Bley (@max_bley3 ), was done in order to celebrate the APS' 40th anniversary, which takes place in October. The shirt celebrates Alberta palaeontology in all of its forms. This shirt is available for both adults and children. See our online store (https://albertapaleo.org/store/ ) or you can purchase them during our monthly meetings. Thanks Max for the awesome design! #palaeontology #paleontology #alberta",
